{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"12751","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/12751","key":"MC-173020","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"23/Feb/20 2:25 PM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>While testing on how to pickup ghasts with minecarts, I found that some heights are \"cursed\" as a minecart cannot pickup a ghast where it will at others heights. That happen on versions 1.12.2, 1.15.2 and 1.16.1.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>If a minecart is more than 2 blocks up from a vertical sub-chunk border, it will never pick entities located in the vertical sub-chunk below the border.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Place a soul sand block at Y=15</li>\n\t<li>At Y=18, make a 3 by 3 blocks square rail line floating around the soul sand</li>\n\t<li>Spawn a wither-skeleton on the soul sand</li>\n\t<li>Launch a empty minecart on the rail circle<br>\n→ <img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> The minecart will not pickup the wither-skeleton, but it will if the setup is make one block offset vertically</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Codeanalysis\"></a>Code analysis</h3>\n<p>From analysis on Minecraft java 1.15.1:</p>\n\n<p>The bug comes from the <tt>getEntities</tt> functions in <tt>net.minecraft.world.level.chunk.LevelChunk</tt>. These functions will look at sub-chunks only 2 blocks down and up from a given collision box; so it can miss entities taller than 2 blocks.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"20/Jun/20 10:49 PM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/16971","id":"16971","filename":"fixed3.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"J Z","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Berlin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"18/Nov/24 8:10 AM","size":"9.94 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/16971"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/16972","id":"16972","filename":"MC-173020 Cannot Reproduce in 24w46a.mp4","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"JervieA20","active":true,"timeZone":"Asia/Manila","accountType":"customer"},"created":"18/Nov/24 6:20 AM","size":"2.06 MB","mimeType":"video/mp4","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/16972"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/16973","id":"16973","filename":"Minecart_pickup_bug.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.pro